    "title": "DICK'S Sporting Goods",
    "description": "DICK\u2019S Sporting Goods gives you exclusive access to offers, ScoreCard points tracking, rewards, and access to all the gear you need. You\u2019ll find all the sporting goods you need for football, baseball, soccer and more, plus the latest sports apparel and footwear.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nShop: Shop anytime, anywhere or find a store near you.\r\n\r\nMove: Earn ScoreCard points for achieving your activity goals each day by integrating with Apple Health, Garmin, Fitbit and MapMyRun. Hit daily goals just by walking/moving!\r\n\r\nGet Rewards: Manage your ScoreCard, scan Rewards and track your points.\r\n\r\nEvery Season Starts at DICK\u2019S.",
